<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρεγγῠς</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>near at hand, close by</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς π. τόποις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					605b25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of Time,
				<i>near</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίαν π. εἶναι</span>,
			i. e. in age, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1335a1
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινός</span>
			<i>following closely on</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				773b9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>nearly alike</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1040b11
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. τῆς λέξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>SE</u>
					167a5
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ταύτης</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πολιτείας</span>) <i>nearly
			resembling</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1271b20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.17.9
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
